-- the general form, which the glucose case forces and which the three layers above are values of. The
-- rate of a motion is a function of the whole situation and not of the temperature alone: heating glucose
-- leaves its anomers resolved and a spoonful of base averages them, so what else is dissolved sets the
-- rate as much as the temperature does.
--
-- a medium: whether it is chiral, and whether it catalyses the changes in question
Medium : Type 0
Medium = (chiral : Bool) × Bool
